  - m_Id: 1334358083
    m_Localized: 'Warrior: +10% slash damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358084
    m_Localized: When your armor breaks, a ring of fire bursts out, damaging and
      knocking back nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358085
    m_Localized: Crits instantly restore 2 Mana and give +20% move speed for 1.5s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358086
    m_Localized: 'Stand still 1s: your next shot pierces and deals +40% damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358087
    m_Localized: Every 3rd hit summons an arcane vortex on the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358088
    m_Localized: "Arcane Storm \xB7 20s cooldown: a large arcane vortex around you
      for 3s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358089
    m_Localized: 'Warrior: +2 Armor and +1 Max HP.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358090
    m_Localized: "Raise Shield \xB7 18s cooldown: immune to all damage for 2s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358091
    m_Localized: No Role effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358092
    m_Localized: 'Mage: +20 Max Mana and +10% Attack Speed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358093
    m_Localized: 'Assassin: +12% Crit chance and +15% Attack Damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358094
    m_Localized: 'Warrior: +1 Max Armor and +10% Attack Speed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334358095
    m_Localized: 'Ranger: +10% Crit chance and +10% Move Speed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
